{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-chedi-private-residences-al-seeb-development-barsha-heights","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":72,"crm_id":"1639","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"The Chedi Private Residences","slug":"the-chedi-private-residences-al-seeb-development-barsha-heights","display_address":"Barsha Heights (Tecom)","building_type":["villa","duplex","mansions","branded"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Al Seeb Development","price":5500000,"display_price":"5.5M","lattitude":25.0979826,"longitude":55.1765832,"min_bedrooms":2,"max_bedrooms":8,"display_bedrooms":"2,3,4,5,6,8","about":"<p>Set along the prestigious Sheikh Zayed Road, The Chedi Private Residences by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-al-seeb-development/\">Al Seeb Development</a> is a super luxury project with <strong>2 to 5-bedroom villas and 6 and 8-bedroom mansions</strong>. Designed by Studio Bruno Guélaff, this 52-story architectural marvel offers fully equipped, branded, and serviced residences, ensuring an effortless blend of luxury and convenience. The off-plan development enjoys a prime location, making it a coveted address for both investors and homeowners seeking exclusivity in the city's dynamic landscape.</p><p>Beyond its striking design, &nbsp;The Chedi Private Residences at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/sheikh-zayed-road/\">Sheikh Zayed Road</a> offers a world-class lifestyle across three distinct amenity levels—Ground Social, Resort Social, and Sky Social. Residents can indulge in a 60-meter lagoon-inspired pool, an adults-only infinity pool, exclusive Omakase dining, private cabanas, a wellness terrace, a state-of-the-art fitness center, a cinema, and a cigar lounge. Complemented by Chedi Navigator concierge services, valet parking, and round-the-clock security, this freehold residential landmark sets a new standard for luxury, privacy, and exclusivity in Dubai’s thriving real estate landscape.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_b4eef03510.jpg","hash":"he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_b4eef03510","name":"he Chedi Private Residences by Al Seeb Development"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_0d783ff693.jpg","hash":"he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_0d783ff693","name":"he Chedi Private Residences by Al Seeb Development"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_56be114269.jpg","hash":"he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_56be114269","name":"he Chedi Private Residences by Al Seeb Development"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_a9ad042318.jpg","hash":"he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_a9ad042318","name":"he Chedi Private Residences by Al Seeb Development"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_025a977333.jpg","hash":"he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_025a977333","name":"he Chedi Private Residences by Al Seeb Development"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_87e5585512.jpg","hash":"he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_87e5585512","name":"he Chedi Private Residences by Al Seeb Development"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_a2462edac