:"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_4d46cedbf5.jpg","hash":"he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_4d46cedbf5","name":"he Chedi Private Residences by Al Seeb Development"}],"images":[],"characteristics_module":{"id":1352,"cta":{"id":2121,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Find out more","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_9040d916f3.jpg","hash":"he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_9040d916f3","name":"he Chedi Private Residences by Al Seeb Development"},"style":null,"title":"Luxury Redefined – The Chedi Private Residences at Barsha Heights","heading":"UNIQUE SELLING POINTS","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Prime Location – Strategically positioned on Sheikh Zayed Road, ensuring excellent connectivity to Dubai’s key destinations, including Downtown Dubai, Palm Jumeirah, Dubai Marina, and Mall of the Emirates.</li><li>Exclusive Luxury Residences – Offers a limited collection of 2- to 8-bedroom sky villas, duplexes, and the iconic triplex Pinnacle Mansion, designed for ultimate privacy and sophistication.</li><li>Breathtaking Views – Features 270° panoramic views of the Dubai skyline, Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary, and a world-class golf course, elevating the living experience.</li><li>Unparalleled Amenities – Spans three distinct levels: Ground Social, Resort Social, and Sky Social, offering a 60-meter lagoon pool, adults-only infinity pool, private cabanas, wellness terrace, fitness center, cigar lounge, and Omakase dining experience.</li><li>Iconic Architecture – Designed by Studio Bruno Guelaff, the 254-meter tower with a sleek glass façade represents a fusion of Asian-inspired elegance and contemporary luxury.</li><li>The Chedi Hospitality Experience – Residents enjoy concierge services, valet parking, private event planning, housekeeping, and secure parking, reflecting The Chedi’s award-winning legacy in luxury hospitality.</li><li>Freehold Ownership &amp; Flexible Payment Plan – Fully branded and serviced freehold residences with a structured post-handover payment plan, making it an ideal investment opportunity.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1353,"cta":{"id":2122,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_6e80eab69d.jpg","hash":"he_Chedi_Private_Residences_by_Al_Seeb_Development_6e80eab69d","name":"he Chedi Private Residences by Al Seeb Development"},"style":null,"title":"A Prestigious Address with Unrivaled Connectivity to Dubai’s Key Landmarks.","heading":"LOCATION","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>The Chedi Private Residences location in Barsha Heights along Sheikh Zayed Road (E11) places residents at the heart of Dubai’s most dynamic district. Barsha Heights is a vibrant mixed-use community in Dubai, offering a blend of residential, commercial, and hotel spaces. Known for its central location, it provides easy access to Sheikh Zayed Road, Dubai Internet City, and key business hubs.</p><ul><li>1 Minute – Sheikh Zayed Road</li><li>5 Minutes – Emirates Golf Club</li><li>6 Minutes – Dubai Marina</li><li>6 Minutes – Mall of the Emirates</li><li>10 Minutes – Palm Jumeirah</li><li>10 Minutes – Burj Al Arab</li><li>10 Minutes – Jumeirah Beach Residence (JBR)</li><li>15 Minutes – Downtown Dubai</li><li>20 Minutes – Dubai International Airport</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3646,"url":null,"file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Chedi_Residences_Brochure_